  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P039-B005",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 39,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "323.2.a"
      ],
      "text": "323.2.a.             如果发生战斗的战场上存在没有被指定为进攻方或防守方的单位,则其立即获得与其控制者相同的攻防身\n                     份。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P091-B020",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 91,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "463"
      ],
      "text": "463.     如果同一片战场中同时存在两名敌对玩家控制的单位,但战斗步骤尚未启动,则该战斗视为待发生状态。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P091-B021",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 91,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "463.1"
      ],
      "text": "463.1.         如果同时有多片战场存在两名敌对玩家控制的单位,则由回合玩家决定先对哪场战斗进行结算。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P094-B009",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 94,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "467.3"
      ],
      "text": "467.3.             2.跳过 FEPR 流程,并取消所有未决任务。进入结算步骤。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P094-B011",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 94,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.1"
      ],
      "text": "468.1.             1.进行一次战斗清理。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P094-B015",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 94,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.2"
      ],
      "text": "468.2.             以下任务变为未决:",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B002",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.3"
      ],
      "text": "468.3.           1.判定战斗结果",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B003",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.3.a"
      ],
      "text": "468.3.a.               如果一名玩家获得进攻方或防守方身份,且在本步骤中仅有该玩家有单位存活于此战场上,则该玩家赢\n                       得战斗。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B004",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.3.b"
      ],
      "text": "468.3.b.               如果一名玩家获得进攻方或防守方身份,且在本步骤中仅有该玩家未在此战场上剩下任何单位,则该玩\n                       家 输掉战斗。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B005",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.3.c"
      ],
      "text": "468.3.c.               该战场上的单位会继承其控制者的战斗结果。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B008",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.4"
      ],
      "text": "468.4.           以下任务变为未决:\n                      提示:执行此步骤前,先结算所有因判定战斗结果及其相关 FEPR 流程而加入结算链的项目。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B009",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.5"
      ],
      "text": "468.5.           1.如果该位置没有标记处于待发生状态的法术对决或战斗,则此处有单位存活的玩家对该战场确立控制(如果尚未控\n                 制该战场)。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B015",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.6"
      ],
      "text": "468.6.           以下任务变为未决:\n                     提示:执行此步骤前,先结算所有因确立控制及其相关 FEPR 流程而加入结算链的项目。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B016",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.7"
      ],
      "text": "468.7.           1.战斗结束。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P095-B017",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 95,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "468.7.a"
      ],
      "text": "468.7.a.              移除所有单位和玩家的进攻方与防守方身份。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
